    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person horror walking game where player controls president Trump in fictional world horror World Trump mission is to collect death people golden skulls to get achievements in scary horror open world. Trump hasn't enemies left but his only mission is to find golden skulls hidden in different locations like abandoned hospital, bloody manor, church and slaughter house. Can you be hero Trump and have daring to meet bloody places with full of death in this horror walking game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Steam achievements by collecting skulls</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lot of blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different areas like graveyard, hospital, manor and slaughter house</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction. Names, characters, places and events are the products of the authors\u2019 imagination. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, or actual events is purely coincidental.</p>",
